00:16:50.487 --> 00:16:51.939
The Tools

00:16:52.945 --> 00:16:55.983
Think of it like a vending machine for

00:16:56.045 --> 00:16:57.343
design.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:01.344
Make a selection, get a result.

00:17:02.119 --> 00:17:03.819
Every time.

00:17:04.579 --> 00:17:08.112
A tool is a ready-to-use creative template

00:17:08.188 --> 00:17:10.830
that knows exactly what it's making and

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:11.919
how.

00:17:12.685 --> 00:17:15.901
Give it a headline, a date, a number - and

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:19.494
it produces a finished asset, to spec.

00:17:20.306 --> 00:17:23.468
No design experience needed.

00:17:24.259 --> 00:17:27.023
No decisions about fonts, colors or

00:17:27.085 --> 00:17:30.219
spacing - the tool already knows best.

00:17:30.982 --> 00:17:33.758
Whether you're a designer, a marketer, a

00:17:33.811 --> 00:17:37.314
developer or an AI agent, the output is

00:17:37.372 --> 00:17:38.670
the same.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.151
Tools are authored once by the people who

00:17:42.211 --> 00:17:45.321
know the brand, and then used by everyone

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:48.709
else - from a web browser, a phone, the

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:52.369
command line or an automated pipeline.

00:17:53.147 --> 00:17:56.279
The design decisions are locked in at the

00:17:56.364 --> 00:17:57.969
template level.

00:17:58.739 --> 00:18:01.574
The only thing left to do is fill in the

00:18:01.637 --> 00:18:02.969
content.
